Package: swisswatch
Architecture: any
Description: Swiss Railway Clock
 Analog clock for GTK4 in the style of the iconic Swiss Railway
 (SBB/CFF/FFS) clock face designed by Hans Hilfiker, including the
 characteristic "railroad" motion: the red second hand sweeps the dial
 in about 58 seconds, pauses at 12, and the minute hand then jumps.
 .
 By default it appears as a borderless circular window floating on the
 desktop.  Several other faces are available, including Mario Botta's
 design and an emulation of the classic oclock.  Works under both
 Wayland and X11.
